Spec: HTTP Server API
Purpose: Defines the API contracts and endpoints for the http-server.

Must:
  All error responses MUST be strictly formatted as JSON:API error payloads (`{"errors": [{"status": "...", "title": "...", "detail": "..."}]}`). Plain-text error responses are forbidden.
  The `/api/v1/auth/session` endpoint MUST capture the `client_ip`.
  The `/api/v1/auth/session` endpoint MUST verify that `is_active` is true in `admin_users`, and explicitly reject the request (403 Forbidden) if the user is inactive.
  The `/api/v1/auth/me` endpoint MUST return `first_name`, `last_name`, `is_active`, and `client_ip`.
